{%- layout none -%}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover">
<title>VAURE · Les exercices</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#140b08">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:ital,wght@0,700;0,800;1,800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
{{ 'vaure-seances.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<style>@media (max-width:380px){.av-top{grid-template-columns:92px 1fr!important;gap:12px!important}.av-prev{width:92px!important;height:160px!important}.av-top h2{font-size:30px!important}.av-top p{font-size:13px!important}}</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="shell" id="shell">
<section class="scr" id="tab-home">
<header class="hh">
<div class="hrow"><a href="/" aria-label="Retour au site VAURE" style="display:flex"><svg class="logo" viewBox="0 -6 616 112" aria-label="VAURE"><g fill="none" stroke="#2b1710" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M52 96 L98 14" stroke-width="13"/><path d="M52 96 L22 30" stroke-width="13"/><path d="M28 44 L74 16" stroke-width="7"/></g><circle cx="16" cy="13" r="10" fill="#2ef27a"/><g transform="translate(140 0)" fill="none" stroke="#2b1710" stroke-width="11" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 2 L38 98 L74 2"/><path transform="translate(98 0)" d="M2 98 L38 2 L74 98"/><path transform="translate(200 0)" d="M4 2 V60 C4 84 18 98 38 98 C58 98 72 84 72 60 V2"/><path transform="translate(300 0)" d="M4 98 V2 H40 C60 2 70 14 70 30 C70 46 60 58 40 58 H4 M38 58 L70 98"/><path transform="translate(398 0)" d="M66 2 H4 V98 H66 M4 50 H54"/></g></svg></a><button class="me" id="meBtn"><svg viewBox="380 -470 200 480" id="meMini"><g></g></svg>Ma silhouette</button></div>
<h1 class="bc">Le défi <em>30 jours</em></h1>
<div class="prog"><div class="pt"><span><b id="doneN">0</b>/ 30 jours faits</span><span id="pPct">0 %</span></div><div class="pbar"><i id="pbar"></i></div></div>
</header>
<div class="today" id="today"></div>
<div class="sec">
<h3 class="bc">Le programme</h3>
<div class="grid" id="grid"></div>
<div class="legend" id="legend"></div>
<p class="after">Après le jour 30, tu continues : <b>une séance chaque jour, toute l'année.</b></p>
<p class="safe"><b>Ta sécurité d'abord.</b> Chaque exercice a une version plus facile, indiquée avant de commencer. En cas de grossesse, de douleur ou de problème de dos, demande l'avis d'un professionnel de santé avant de commencer.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="scr" id="tab-music" hidden>
<div class="mh">
<div class="hrow"><a href="/" aria-label="Retour au site VAURE" style="display:flex"><svg class="logo" viewBox="0 -6 616 112" aria-label="VAURE"><g fill="none" stroke="#2b1710" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M52 96 L98 14" stroke-width="13"/><path d="M52 96 L22 30" stroke-width="13"/><path d="M28 44 L74 16" stroke-width="7"/></g><circle cx="16" cy="13" r="10" fill="#2ef27a"/><g transform="translate(140 0)" fill="none" stroke="#2b1710" stroke-width="11" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 2 L38 98 L74 2"/><path transform="translate(98 0)" d="M2 98 L38 2 L74 98"/><path transform="translate(200 0)" d="M4 2 V60 C4 84 18 98 38 98 C58 98 72 84 72 60 V2"/><path transform="translate(300 0)" d="M4 98 V2 H40 C60 2 70 14 70 30 C70 46 60 58 40 58 H4 M38 58 L70 98"/><path transform="translate(398 0)" d="M66 2 H4 V98 H66 M4 50 H54"/></g></svg></a><span class="tag" style="color:var(--muted)">Musique</span></div>
<h1 class="bc">Ta <em>musique</em></h1>
<p>Connecte ta playlist une fois : elle reste là et continue de jouer pendant toute la séance.</p>
</div>
</section>
<div class="dock hide" id="dock">
<div class="dk-mini">
<span class="ic"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M9 18.5a3 3 0 1 1-2-2.83V5l12-2v12.5a3 3 0 1 1-2-2.83V7.3L9 8.8z"/></svg></span>
<div><b id="dkName">Ta musique</b><small>Elle continue pendant la séance</small></div>
<button id="dkShow">Afficher</button>
</div>
<div class="dk-full">
<div class="dk-head"><span class="k">Ta musique</span><button id="dkClose">Fermer</button></div>
<div class="dk-frame" id="dkFrame"><div id="dkSlot"></div><div class="src"><span id="dkSrc"></span><button id="dkRemove">Changer</button></div></div>
<form class="dk-form" id="dkForm" autocomplete="off">
<label for="dkUrl">Colle le lien de ta playlist</label>
<div class="dk-in"><input id="dkUrl" type="url" inputmode="url" placeholder="https://open.spotify.com/playlist/…"><button type="submit">Connecter</button></div>
<p class="dk-msg" id="dkMsg"></p>
</form>
<div id="dkHelp">
<ol class="how">
<li>Ouvre ton appli de musique et choisis une playlist.</li>
<li>Appuie sur « Partager », puis « Copier le lien ».</li>
<li>Colle le lien ici et appuie sur « Connecter ».</li>
</ol>
<div class="plats">
<a href="https://open.spotify.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Spotify</a>
<a href="https://www.deezer.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Deezer</a>
<a href="https://music.apple.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apple Music</a>
<a href="https://music.youtube.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">YouTube</a>
</div>
<p class="tip">Connecte-toi à ton compte dans le lecteur pour écouter les morceaux en entier. Sans compte, certaines plateformes ne jouent que des extraits.<br>Tu préfères ton appli ? Lance ta musique avant la séance : elle continue de jouer pendant que tu t'entraînes.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<nav class="nav" id="nav">
<button data-tab="home" class="on"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="17" rx="3"/><path d="M3 9h18M8 2v4M16 2v4"/></svg>Séances</button>
<button data-tab="music"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 18V5l12-2v13"/><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3"/><circle cx="18" cy="16" r="3"/></svg>Musique</button>
</nav>
<div class="veil" id="veil"></div>
<div class="sheet" id="sheet" role="dialog" aria-modal="true"></div>
<div class="app" id="app">
<div class="top">
<button class="x" id="quit" aria-label="Quitter la séance"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" stroke="#2b1710" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M3 3l10 10M13 3L3 13"/></svg></button>
<div class="day" id="dayLbl"></div>
<button class="mus" id="musBtn"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M9 18.5a3 3 0 1 1-2-2.83V5l12-2v12.5a3 3 0 1 1-2-2.83V7.3L9 8.8z"/></svg>Musique</button>
</div>
<div class="segs" id="segs"></div>
<div class="title"><div class="n" id="num"></div><h1 class="bc" id="name"></h1><div class="kit" id="kit"></div></div>
<div class="mode" id="mode"><button data-m="timer">Minuteur</button><button data-m="rythme">À ton rythme</button></div>
<svg class="scene" viewBox="140 -400 600 440" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true">
<defs>
<radialGradient id="glow"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#2ef27a" stop-opacity=".35"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#2ef27a" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient>
<linearGradient id="matg" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#6a3726"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#43211a"/></linearGradient>
</defs>
<ellipse cx="420" cy="18" rx="330" ry="22" fill="#2b1710" opacity=".10"/>
<rect x="130" y="-2" width="580" height="14" rx="7" fill="url(#matg)"/>
<circle id="hl" cx="0" cy="0" r="90" fill="url(#glow)"/>
<g id="kitBack"></g>
<g id="body"></g>
<g id="kitFront"></g>
<g id="arw" fill="none" stroke="#2ef27a" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></g>
</svg>
<div class="pausedTag"><span>En pause</span></div>
<div class="round" id="round"></div>
<div class="cue" id="cue"></div>
<div class="bottom">
<div class="repbox"><span id="reps">1</span><small id="repn">/ 10</small></div>
<div class="side"><div class="time" id="time">00:40</div><div class="lbl" id="tlbl">Restant</div></div>
<button class="ctl pz" id="pause" aria-label="Pause"><svg width="22" height="26" viewBox="0 0 22 26" id="pzIc"><rect x="2" y="2" width="6" height="22" rx="2" fill="#2b1710"/><rect x="14" y="2" width="6" height="22" rx="2" fill="#2b1710"/></svg></button>
<button class="fin" id="fin">Fini ✓</button>
<button class="ctl" id="skip" aria-label="Passer à la suite"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="#2b1710"><path d="M3 3l11 8-11 8z"/><rect x="16" y="3" width="3.5" height="16" rx="1.5"/></svg></button>
</div>
<div class="prep" id="prep">
<div class="ph"><div><div class="pk" id="pk">Prépare ton matériel</div><div class="pn bc" id="pname"></div></div><svg class="pic" id="picon" viewBox="0 0 80 80"></svg></div>
<ol id="psteps"></ol>
<div class="easy" id="easy"></div>
<div class="pf"><div class="cd"><b id="cd">10</b><span id="cdl">Ça commence</span></div><button class="go" id="go">Je suis prête →</button></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="end" id="end">
<span class="tag" id="endDay"></span>
<h1 class="bc">Séance <em>terminée</em></h1>
<p id="endTxt"></p>
<div class="stats"><div><b id="sMin">0</b>minutes</div><div><b id="sEx">0</b>exercices</div><div><b id="sDone">0</b>/ 30 jours</div></div>
<button class="btn" id="endBack">Retour au programme</button>
</div>
</div>
<script src="{{ 'vaure-seances.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
</body></html>
